@startuml
title Microwave Oven Control - State Diagram

state "Door Shut" as DoorShut
state "Door Open" as DoorOpen
state "Door Open With Item" as DoorOpenItem
state "Door Shut With Item" as DoorShutItem
state "Ready To Cook" as ReadyToCook
state Cooking
state "Checking"
state Alarm
state Done
state "Waiting"

DoorShut --> DoorOpen : User Opens Door
DoorOpen --> DoorOpenItem : User Places Food
DoorOpenItem --> DoorShutItem : User Closes Door
DoorShutItem --> ReadyToCook : User Enters Cook Time

ReadyToCook --> Checking
Checking --> Cooking : No Issues Detected
Checking --> Alarm : Turntable Fault
Checking --> Alarm : Emitter Fault

Cooking --> Done : Timeout or Door Opened
Cooking --> Cooking : Time
Done --> Waiting : Operation Stopped or Cancelled

DoorOpen --> Disabled : Operation in Progress
Disabled --> Waiting : Door Closed or User Cancels
Alarm --> Disabled

Case ID: case_73_oven
Complexity: medium

title Microwave Oven Control - State Diagram for Oven

state "Door Shut" as DoorShutOven
state "Door Open" as DoorOpenOven
state "Door Open With Item" as DoorOpenItemOven
state "Door Shut With Item" as DoorShutItemOven
state "Ready To Cook" as ReadyToCookOven
state CookingOven
state "Checking"
state AlarmOven
state DoneOven
state "Waiting"

DoorShutOven --> DoorOpenOven : User Opens Door
DoorOpenOven --> DoorOpenItemOven : User Places Food
DoorOpenItemOven --> DoorShutItemOven : User Closes Door
DoorShutItemOven --> ReadyToCookOven : User Enters Cook Time

ReadyToCookOven --> Checking
Checking --> CookingOven : No Issues Detected
Checking --> AlarmOven : Turntable Fault
Checking --> AlarmOven : Emitter Fault

CookingOven --> DoneOven : Timeout or Door Opened
CookingOven --> CookingOven : Time
DoneOven --> Waiting : Operation Stopped or Cancelled

DoorOpenOven --> DisabledOven : Operation in Progress
DisabledOven --> Waiting : Door Closed or User Cancels
AlarmOven --> DisabledOven

Case ID: case_69_atm_many_scenarios_6
Complexity: medium

title ATM Control - Validate PIN and Withdraw Funds

state Idle
state "Entering PIN" as EnteringPIN
state "Incorrect PIN" as IncorrectPIN
state "Invalid Card" as InvalidCard
state "Security Hold" as SecurityHold
state "Cancelled" as Cancelled
state "Options" as Options
state "Processing Transaction" as ProcessingTransaction
state "Rejected" as Rejected
state "Dispensing Cash" as DispensingCash
state "Printing Receipt" as PrintingReceipt
state "Out of Cash" as OutOfCash
state "Resetting" as Resetting

Idle --> EnteringPIN
EnteringPIN --> IncorrectPIN : Incorrect PIN Entered
EnteringPIN --> Options : Correct PIN Entered
IncorrectPIN --> InvalidCard : Card is Invalid
IncorrectPIN --> SecurityHold : User Keeps Entering Incorrect PIN
Options --> ProcessingTransaction : User Chooses Option
ProcessingTransaction --> Rejected : Transaction Rejected
ProcessingTransaction --> DispensingCash : Cash Dispensed
ProcessingTransaction --> PrintingReceipt : Receipt Printed
ProcessingTransaction --> OutOfCash : ATM Runs out of Cash
ProcessingTransaction --> Resetting : Transaction Completed or Cancelled
Resetting --> Idle : Ready for Next User
@enduml
